@startuml
actor Learner
participant Web
participant "GotIt Backend" as API
database "Product PostgreSQL" as DB
Learner -> Web: Choose content / skip / restore
alt Choose content
 Web -> API: Read active version + selected lesson
 API -> DB: Resolve owned current content
 API --> Web: Actual selected context / stale conflict
else Skip or restore
 Web -> Learner: Confirm unfinished unit scope (unit only)
 Web -> API: Explicit choice + revision + operation UUID
 API -> DB: Scoped lock / receipt replay / compare revision
 DB -> DB: Save navigation choice separately from evidence
 DB --> API: Committed choice receipt
 API --> Web: Updated path / conflict
 Web -> Learner: Completed / skipped / remaining + next action
end
note over API,DB: No fabricated attempts, mastery, XP, streak or placement
@enduml
